      "previewText": "The isotope 65Ga undergoes radioactive decay, with decay constant λ = 0.0456/min. What is the half-life of 65Ga?  minHow long will it take for @@PerDecaysf@@% of a sample of 65Ga to decay?  minWhat is the activity (decay rate) for @@Mass@@ mg Ga-65?  decays/s",
      "targeted": [],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "children": [],
          "data": [
            {
              "children": [],
              "expression": "// Two variable definitions\nconst PerArray = [30,35,40,45,55,60,65,70,80,85];\nconst PerIndex = OLI.random(0,9);\nconst PerDecay = PerArray[PerIndex];\nconst PerDecaysf = PerDecay .toPrecision(3);\nconst PerLeft = 100-PerDecay;\nconst PerLeftsf= PerLeft .toPrecision(3);\nconst PerRatio = (PerLeft/100);\nconst lnPart = Math.log(PerRatio);\nconst Time = -lnPart/0.0456;\nconst Timesf = Time .toPrecision(3);\nconst TimeLow = Time*0.97;\nconst TimeHigh = Time*1.03;\n\nconst MassArray = [4.5,5,5.5,6,6.5,7,7.5,8,8.5,9,9.5];\nconst MassIndex = OLI.random(0,10);\nconst Mass = MassArray[MassIndex];\nconst Masssf = Mass .toPrecision(3);\nconst AtomsCoeff = Mass*0.92646;\nconst AtomsCoeffsf = AtomsCoeff .toPrecision(3);\nconst Activity = Mass*7.0411e15;\nconst ActivityCoeff = Mass*0.70411;\nconst ActivityCoeffsf = ActivityCoeff .toPrecision(3);\nconst ActLow = Activity*0.97;\nconst ActHigh = Activity*1.03;\n\n// Expose variables to OLI\nmodule.exports = {\n PerArray, \n PerIndex, \n PerDecay, \n PerDecaysf, \n PerLeft, \n PerLeftsf, \n PerRatio, \n lnPart, \n Time, \n Timesf, \n TimeLow, \n TimeHigh, \n MassArray, \n MassIndex, \n Mass, \n Masssf,\n AtomsCoeff,\n AtomsCoeffsf,\n Activity, \n ActivityCoeff, \n ActivityCoeffsf, \n ActLow, \n ActHigh\n};\n",
              "id": "b473601d79444cf2a2e2f860326c3a45",
